  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A Network for Growth in Southern Africa - b labs</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Business labs - n&#xe4;tverk</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det f&#xf6;reslagna projektet har som m&#xe5;l att implementera tv&#xe5;             inkubatorer, en i Botswana och en i Namibia, under ett &#xe5;r. Inkubator  modellen - kallad Business Lab - &#xf6;ppnar upp f&#xf6;r lokala entrepren&#xf6;rer  s&#xe5; att de kan n&#xe5; ut p&#xe5; marknaden med sina aff&#xe4;rsid&#xe9;er. St&#xf6;d&#xe5;tg&#xe4;rder i labbet &#xe4;r workshops, coachning, marknadsf&#xf6;ring och support genom r&#xe5;d.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project aims to implementate two incubators, one in      Botswana and one in Namibia, druing one year. The concept is that the incubator model - called business lab - will open up for local        entrepreneurs so that they can reach out on the market with their     business ideas. Supporting activities in the lab are workshops,       coaching, marketing and support through advices.</narrative>
  </description>
